!! !Name:
!!   Open_TSI
!!
!! !Description:
!!    Routine ID - 7.2.1.5
!!
!!    Purpose - Opens the TSI input file
!!
!! !Input Parameters:
!!    NONE 
!!
!! !Output Parameters:
!!    NONE 
!!
!! !Team-Unique Header:
!!
!!  Modules Used: (Parameters followed by "*" are defined by this routine)
!!   SARB_IO_Utils     - (SARBlib) Params: Flag_File_Direct, Flag_File_Read, 
!!                                         Flag_File_Unformat
!!                                 Sbr. SARB_GenOpen
!!   SynSARB_IO_Params - (SARBlib) Params: RecLen_TSI*, IUnit_TSI* 
!!   tsi_type_mod      - (CERESlib) Structures: TSI_TYPE
!!
!! !Revision History:
!!  Version 3.4  June 20, 2003 - SCCR #445  
!!               Lisa Coleman, SAIC, l.h.coleman@larc.nasa.gov
!!               Initial version of code
!!
!! !END
!!
!!*****************************************************************************
!!
!!
!      CHARACTER (LEN=11), PARAMETER :: Name_Sbr = 'Open_TSI ()'
!      TYPE (TSI_TYPE)               :: TSI_DATA
!!
!!
!! *** Get TSI record length
!!
!      TSI_DATA % timeandloc % julhr = 0.0
!      INQUIRE (IOLENGTH = RecLen_TSI) TSI_DATA!
!
!!!      print *, 'RecLen_TSI = ', RecLen_TSI
!!
!!
!! *** Open TSI file
